/-!
# Pair-occurrence lift of the actual nonlinear Duhamel regeneration

The quadratic restart obstruction is carried by the actual nonlinear
regeneration row, not by a postulated provenance norm.  This module lifts the
same causal Duhamel integral through the complete typed input-pair table before
Fourier aggregation:

```text
tsum input-pair causal occurrences
  = same-receipt nonlinear Duhamel row
  = actual whole-restart regeneration row.
```

Every occurrence uses the receipt's own physical time, heat kernel and pair
vector.  The integral/series interchange is generated by the actual bounded
whole path and its transverse `L²_t(ℓ²)` representative; no cutoff, pair
weight, norm on provenance, target state or coercive quantum is supplied.
-/

